# 🎯 HireMatch.AI

Transform your job hunt with AI-powered application screening — paste any job description, upload your resume, and instantly see your match score, missing keywords, skill gaps, and get a tailored cover letter. HireMatch.AI helps you understand exactly why you're not getting interviews and gives you the tools to fix it, leveraging Google Gemini's AI capabilities.

![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/status-live-success) ![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-blue) ![Tech](https://img.shields.io/badge/tech-fullstack-purple) ![AI](https://img.shields.io/badge/AI-Gemini%202.0-orange)

**🚀 Live Demo:** [hirematch-ai.vercel.app](https://hirematch-ai.vercel.app)

---

## ✨ Features

- 🎯 **AI Match Scoring**: Get an instant 0–100% match score between your resume and any job description using Google Gemini
- 🔍 **Keyword Gap Analysis**: See exactly which keywords from the JD are missing from your resume — the same ones ATS systems filter on
- 📊 **Skill Alignment Bars**: Visual breakdown of how well each skill category aligns, with specific notes on each
- ✍️ **Resume Bullet Rewriter**: Paste any bullet from your resume and get an ATS-optimised rewrite tailored to that specific job
- 📝 **Cover Letter Generator**: Generates a full tailored cover letter referencing both your resume details and the JD requirements
- 📁 **Application Tracker**: Saves every analysis to your personal dashboard — track status from Applied → Interviewing → Offered
- ⚡ **Job Search Intelligence**: Surface patterns across all your applications — recurring missing keywords, average match score, interview conversion rate, and more
- 🔐 **Secure Authentication**: Full email/password auth via Supabase with Row Level Security ensuring users only access their own data

## 🛠 Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** HTML5, CSS3, Vanilla JavaScript
- **AI Engine:** Google Gemini 2.0 Flash
- **Backend:** Vercel Serverless Functions (Node.js)
- **Database:** Supabase PostgreSQL
- **Authentication:** Supabase Auth (Email/Password)
- **PDF Parsing:** PDF.js
- **Deployment:** Vercel (auto-deploy from GitHub)

## 📋 Prerequisites

Before you begin, make sure you have the following ready:

- A **GitHub** account
- A **Vercel** account ([vercel.com](https://vercel.com))
- A **Supabase** account ([supabase.com](https://supabase.com))
- A **Google AI Studio** account for Gemini API ([aistudio.google.com](https://aistudio.google.com))
- A modern web browser (Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari)

## ⚙️ Installation

### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Nion9/hirematch-ai.git
cd hirematch-ai
```

### 2. Set Up Supabase

Create a new project at [supabase.com](https://supabase.com), then:

```sql
-- Open SQL Editor and run the schema
-- File: supabase-setup.sql
```

Copy your **Project URL** and **anon public key** from `Settings → API Keys`.

### 3. Configure Credentials

Open `index.html`, `app.html`, and `tracker.html`, then replace:

```javascript
const SUPABASE_URL = 'https://your-project.supabase.co';
const SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = 'your-anon-key';
```

### 4. Get a Gemini API Key

1. Go to [aistudio.google.com](https://aistudio.google.com)
2. Click **Get API Key** → **Create API Key**
3. Copy the key (starts with `AIza...`)

### 5. Deploy to Vercel

```bash
git push origin main
```

Then on Vercel:

1. Import your GitHub repository
2. Go to **Settings → Environment Variables**
3. Add: `GEMINI_API_KEY = your-gemini-key`
4. Redeploy

## 🚀 Usage

### Running the Application

Once deployed, your app is live at `https://your-project.vercel.app`.

1. **Sign up** with your email and password
2. **Confirm** your email (check inbox)
3. **Sign in** to access the analyser

### Analysing an Application

1. Navigate to the **Analyser** page
2. Paste the full **job description** in the left panel
3. Upload your **resume** (PDF or TXT) or paste the text
4. Click **Analyse My Application**
5. Review your **match score**, **keyword gaps**, and **improvement suggestions**
6. Use the **Resume Rewriter** to optimise specific bullets for this job
7. Copy the **AI-generated cover letter**
8. Update the **application status** as you progress (Analysed → Applied → Interviewing → Offered)

### Viewing Your Intelligence Dashboard

Navigate to **My Applications** to see:

- Total applications analysed
- Average match score across all roles
- Interview conversion rate
- Recurring missing keywords (which skills to focus on learning)
- Patterns in your job search

## 📁 Project Structure

```
hirematch-ai/
├── api/
│   └── analyze.js          # Vercel serverless function → Gemini API proxy
├── index.html              # Authentication page (sign in / sign up)
├── app.html                # Main analyser interface
├── tracker.html            # Application tracker dashboard
├── supabase-setup.sql      # Database schema (run once in Supabase)
└── README.md
```

## 🔐 Security

- **Row Level Security (RLS)** policies in Supabase ensure users only access their own data
- **Gemini API key** stored as a Vercel environment variable — never exposed to the client
- **Supabase anon key** is designed for frontend use; security is enforced at the database layer
- **PDF parsing** happens entirely in the browser — your resume never leaves your device until analysed

